ial for pungs and chows in these suits. The J3 provides no synergy and occupies a valuable slot. Discarding it allows me to maintain flexibility with my suited tiles and pursue multiple winning patterns including \"All Chows,\" \"Pure Double Chow,\" or Pung-based hands in the Bamboo suit.\n\nAnswer: Play J3"}
